box86-16k (0.3.8+git20260807.0579f8b+16k10) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Preserve i386 4K madvise semantics on 16K hosts, including raw syscall 219.
  * Size Box86 bridge bricks from the actual host page size, matching Box64's
    large-page bridge allocator instead of hard-coding 4096 bytes.
  * Extend the 16K ELF regression to verify that each bridge brick occupies one
    complete host page before exercising the ELF32 mapping path.

